      "@type": "bootstrap:Process",
      "depiction": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/assets/img/workflows/contributor-feedback.svg",
      "description": "A document is still being written, and the Authoring Committee gives\nfeedback on it in a shared Contributor Feedback sheet. This is what\nhappens to ONE change set, one row of that sheet: a member starts it\nwith a title, the sections it is about and their feedback; the agent\nproposes a direction; an Editor lets the agent edit; the agent makes the\nedit in the row's one pull request, whose staging preview shows what\nchanged; the committee answers on the row; and an Editor lets the agent\nmerge. If the row's feedback changes after the agent wrote its\nproposal, the proposal is marked stale and the row's Ready for agent\ngoes back to No, so the agent proposes again and an Editor decides\nagain. The sheet's colours follow the lanes: Blue for the committee,\nGreen for the agent, Orange for the Editor. Skill: review-sheet-script.",
      "enforcement": "strict",
      "flowCount": 14,
      "inSubgraph": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/folio-assistant-core/directory/core-processes",
