      "description": "The one way an agent reports a move on a change set. The sheet script\nbuilds Agentic status, Agentic status (filter) and Staging review from\nthe Agent tab, and warns that no agent has picked a row up when the\nAgent step is missing or older than Ready for agent. Writing only\nFeedback (agent) leaves those columns stale, so it is never done alone.",
      "enforcement": "strict",
